stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> FreeEnzyme: E exists in\nsolution

    FreeEnzyme --> ES: S binds\n(active site)
    ES --> FreeEnzyme: S dissociates
    ES --> EP: Catalysis\n(k_cat)
    EP --> FreeEnzyme: P released

    FreeEnzyme --> EI_comp: Competitive\ninhibitor binds\n(active site)
    EI_comp --> FreeEnzyme: I dissociates\n(reversible)

    ES --> ESI_uncomp: Uncompetitive\ninhibitor binds\n(only to ES)
    ESI_uncomp --> ES: I dissociates

    FreeEnzyme --> EI_mixed: Mixed inhibitor\nbinds (allosteric site)
    EI_mixed --> FreeEnzyme: I dissociates
    ES --> ESI_mixed: Mixed inhibitor\nalso binds ES
    ESI_mixed --> ES: I dissociates

    FreeEnzyme --> EI_irrev: Irreversible\ninhibitor binds\n(covalent)

    note right of EI_comp: Km↑, Vmax unchanged\nOvercome by high [S]
    note right of ESI_uncomp: Km↓, Vmax↓\n(proportional)
    note right of EI_mixed: Km changed, Vmax↓
    note right of EI_irrev: Permanent inactivation\nCannot be overcome
